(3. Detailed Explanations) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
0 -14 Td
(Normalization systematically removes insertion, update, and deletion anomalies by analyzing functional dependencies. ACID) Tj
0 -12 Td
(guarantees ensure that concurrent database transactions execute reliably without data corruption. B-Tree and hash indexing) Tj
0 -12 Td
(drastically accelerate query performance by reducing disk block I/O operations from O\(N\) full scans to O\(log N\) lookups.) Tj
